+## Privacy threshold for vote tallies
+
+To protect voter privacy, agreement scores and bill tallies are displayed as percentages only after at least ten distinct users have voted. Below this threshold, raw counts are hidden to prevent identification of individual voters.
+
 ## Bill score builders receive one district snapshot
 
 The bills index preloads each score's district rows and supplies one reader-district list to every personalized score builder.
